Package: enigma2-plugin-extensions-epgtoxml
Version: @VERSION@
Section: extra
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Arcardy
Depends: enigma2, python-core, python-json, python-xml, python-sqlite3
Description: Task-based Sky.de EPG importer for Enigma2
 EpgToXml fetches Sky.de EPG data and imports it directly into the
 Enigma2 EPG cache on Dreambox/Newnigma2 OE2.5 receivers. The EPG import
 engine is embedded (derived from EPGImport, GPLv2); no external EPGImport
 plugin is required.
